        "original_id": "4b157bb0-f869-5ac7-b5ec-f377372f579e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: J. Paul Boehmer, Paul Boehmer, John McTiernan, Pierce Brosnan, Rene Russo, Denis Leary\n- Products: The Thomas Crown Affair, The Good German, Star Trek, Gregor and the Code of Claw audiobook\n- Topics: acting careers, film remakes, audiobook releases\n\nFacts:\n- J. Paul Boehmer was born on October 30, 1965, and he is an American actor.\n- J. Paul Boehmer is best known for numerous appearances in the Star Trek universe.\n- The Thomas Crown Affair is a 1999 American heist film directed by John McTiernan.\n- The 1999 film The Thomas Crown Affair stars Pierce Brosnan, Rene Russo, and Denis Leary, and it is a remake of the 1968 film of the same name.\n- J. Paul Boehmer appeared in The Thomas Crown Affair and in The Good German.\n- An audiobook version of Gregor and the Code of Claw was released in 2008 and was read by Paul Boehmer.",
